## RECITALS

**WHEREAS**, the Licensor is the owner, developer, and Original Equipment Manufacturer (OEM) of the proprietary software product known as **"Ooraatchi"** (a Web GIS Based Project Management Software, hereinafter referred to as the **"Software"**); and

**WHEREAS**, the Licensee desires to obtain a licence to use the Software for its internal administrative and governance operations; and

**WHEREAS**, the Parties wish to set out the terms and conditions under which the Licensor grants such licence to the Licensee;

**NOW, THEREFORE**, in consideration of the mutual covenants and agreements set forth herein, and for other good and valuable consideration, the receipt and sufficiency of which are hereby acknowledged, the Parties agree as follows:

